OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal court reserves judgement
OL,4,Aover Drumcree parade dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal has reserved
OL,7,Fjudgement in a bid by Garvaghy Road
OL,8,Fresidents to challenge a decision to
OL,9,Fallow a controversial Orange Order
OL,10,Fparade to go down the predominantly
OL,11,Fnationalist road.
OL,13,FThe deadlock over the proposed march in
OL,14,FPortadown, County Armagh - opposed by
OL,15,Fresidents of the Garvaghy Road - has
OL,16,Flasted since Sunday 27 September.
OL,18,FThe stalemate has reopened what was
OL,19,Fonce the most bitter parading dispute
OL,20,Fin Northern Ireland, with stand-offs in
OL,21,Fthe mid-to-late 1990s accompanied by
OL,22,Friots, roadblocks and killings.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
