OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal court reserves judgement
OL,4,Aover Drumcree parade dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree judges listened to almost four
OL,7,Fhours of legal arguments inside a
OL,8,Fpacked courtroom in Belfast on Monday.
